{"id": "2602.04268", "url": "https://arxiv.org/html/2602.04268v1", "core": [{"section": "A5", "kind": "h2", "text": "Appendix E The Algorithm of KVSmooth"}, {"section": "A5", "kind": "p", "text": "In this section, we present the full algorithmic details of KVSmooth. The algorithm consists of two components: Algorithm 1: EMA Smoothing on KV-Cache, corresponding to Section 4.3 (The Final KVSmooth Method); and Algorithm 2: Attention Forward with Adaptive EMA Smoothing, corresponding to Section 3.1 (Formulation of MLLMs Generation) and Section 4.2 (Entropy-Guided Coefficient Adaptation)."}, {"section": "A5", "kind": "table", "text": "K^t(l,h)←(1−λ~tl)​Kt(l,h)+λ~tl​Kt−1(l,h),\\hat{K}_{t}^{(l,h)}\\leftarrow(1-\\tilde{\\lambda}_{t}^{l})\\,K_{t}^{(l,h)}+\\tilde{\\lambda}_{t}^{l}\\,K_{t-1}^{(l,h)},"}, {"section": "A5", "kind": "table", "text": "V^t(l,h)←(1−λ~tl)​Vt(l,h)+λ~tl​Vt−1(l,h).\\hat{V}_{t}^{(l,h)}\\leftarrow(1-\\tilde{\\lambda}_{t}^{l})\\,V_{t}^{(l,h)}+\\tilde{\\lambda}_{t}^{l}\\,V_{t-1}^{(l,h)}."}, {"section": "A5", "kind": "table", "text": "Kt(l,h)←K^t(l,h),Vt(l,h)←V^t(l,h).K_{t}^{(l,h)}\\leftarrow\\hat{K}_{t}^{(l,h)},\\hskip 18.49988ptV_{t}^{(l,h)}\\leftarrow\\hat{V}_{t}^{(l,h)}."}, {"section": "A5", "kind": "table", "text": "Qt(l,h)=ht​WQ(l,h),Kt(l,h)=ht​WK(l,h),Vt(l,h)=ht​WV(l,h).Q_{t}^{(l,h)}=h_{t}W_{Q}^{(l,h)},\\hskip 9.24994ptK_{t}^{(l,h)}=h_{t}W_{K}^{(l,h)},\\hskip 9.24994ptV_{t}^{(l,h)}=h_{t}W_{V}^{(l,h)}."}, {"section": "A5", "kind": "table", "text": "At,j(l,h)=(Qt(l,h))⊤​Kj(l,h)d+Mt,j.A_{t,j}^{(l,h)}=\\frac{\\bigl(Q_{t}^{(l,h)}\\bigr)^{\\top}K_{j}^{(l,h)}}{\\sqrt{d}}+M_{t,j}."}, {"section": "A5", "kind": "table", "text": "αt,j(l,h)=Softmaxj​(At,j(l,h)),\\alpha_{t,j}^{(l,h)}=\\mathrm{Softmax}_{j}\\!\\bigl(A_{t,j}^{(l,h)}\\bigr),"}, {"section": "A5", "kind": "table", "text": "zt,jl=−1H∑h=0H−1∑i=0L−1αi,j(l,h)log(αi,j(l,h)+ε).z_{t,j}^{\\,l}=-\\frac{1}{H}\\sum_{h=0}^{H-1}\\sum_{i=0}^{L-1}\\alpha_{i,j}^{(l,h)}\\log\\!\\bigl(\\alpha_{i,j}^{(l,h)}+\\varepsilon\\bigr)."}, {"section": "A5", "kind": "table", "text": "λ^tl=k/|Sl|,\\hat{\\lambda}_{t}^{l}=k/|S^{l}|,"}, {"section": "A5", "kind": "table", "text": "λ~tl=clip⁡(λ^tl,λref−0.2,λref+0.2).\\tilde{\\lambda}_{t}^{l}=\\mathrm{clip}\\bigl(\\hat{\\lambda}_{t}^{l},\\ \\lambda_{\\text{ref}}-0.2,\\ \\lambda_{\\text{ref}}+0.2\\bigr)."}, {"section": "A5", "kind": "table", "text": "ot(l,h)=∑j=0L−1αt,j(l,h)​Vj(l,h),o_{t}^{(l,h)}=\\sum_{j=0}^{L-1}\\alpha_{t,j}^{(l,h)}V_{j}^{(l,h)},"}, {"section": "A5", "kind": "table", "text": "htl=Concath​(ot(l,h))​WOl.h_{t}^{l}=\\mathrm{Concat}_{h}(o_{t}^{(l,h)})\\,W_{O}^{l}."}, {"section": "A5", "kind": "table", "text": "(K1:t(l,h),V1:t(l,h))h=1H←EMASmoothingon((K1:t(l,h),V1:t(l,h))h=1H,λ~tl).(K_{1:t}^{(l,h)},V_{1:t}^{(l,h)})_{h=1}^{H}\\leftarrow\\mathrm{EMASmoothingon}\\bigl((K_{1:t}^{(l,h)},V_{1:t}^{(l,h)})_{h=1}^{H},\\tilde{\\lambda}_{t}^{l}\\bigr)."}]}
